  subtitle: "v1.4.16: Shorter mod description with changes listed by version",
  description: "Cheat-grade Chrono blocks for global item and liquid transport, terrain and item conversion, repair, construction, overdrive, unit buffs and debuffs, mind control, and core placement, plus the Outpost, a base that builds mining drones.\n\n[accent]v1.4.16[]\nShorter mod description with changes listed by version.\n\n[accent]v1.4.15[]\nOutpost, Quad Outpost, and Mega Outpost: the mine tier 4 upgrade costs titanium and silicon.\n\n[accent]v1.4.14[]\nNew Chrono Hypno: Yuri converts enemy units and buildings to your side.\n\n[accent]v1.4.13[]\nExtra Outpost mining beams target different ore tiles.\n\n[accent]v1.4.11 - 1.4.12[]\nChrono Item Tiler and Chrono Liquid Tiler paint a square and show their radius.",
  version: "1.4.16",
  minGameVersion: "146"
}
